description KCD, 70.9 min of real streamed gameplay, o:vsync on the defaults (source rate not declared, 60 assumed; comb lock, 75 ms extra lag, flip timing and dejitter on) through Windows.Graphics.Capture, with the synthesized presents drawn by the optical flow warp (the compositor only, the policy is the default's), 2026-10-28, build c3d3e1e; cut to the stretch the stream's video shows before its closing inventory, reading and sleep screens, 47.8 s to 4305.0 s
# What the RELAY did on this capture. The replay model is only trustworthy
# for a configuration where it reproduces these; the test checks that.
